{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements.\n\nThe user's interest is: 摄影学习 (photography learning), focusing on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. Explicitly NOT interested in equipment promotions (器材促销) or photographers' private lives (摄影师私生活).\n\nThe candidates are articles with titles combining a photography topic and a condition/context. Let me categorize them by their content type based on the descriptions:\n\n1. **市场观察 (Market observation)** - These are about camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements, gifts, packaging, reservation benefits. These are **器材促销** content → NOT relevant per user's explicit preference.\n\n2. **专题观察 (Special topic observation)** - These are about photography exhibitions, curatorial threads, author biographies, artwork circulation, art activity historical background and viewing experience. These are about **摄影师生平/艺术活动** → related to photographers' lives/art history, which the user doesn't want (摄影师私生活).\n\n3. **条件与原理 (Conditions and principles)** - These explain from light, imaging, and visual relationships, explaining variable effects and applicable conditions, analyzing when common intuitions fail. → This matches the user's interest in 成像原理与不同条件下的调整.\n\n4. **概念速览 (Concept overview)** - Lists common concepts, briefly explains phenomena. → Relevant to learning.\n\n5. **操作记录 (Operation records)** - Fix composition and light, change parameters one by one, record corresponding images, compare highlights/shadows/subject details, adjust settings. → This matches 实际拍摄方法.\n\nSo the user's interest explicitly wants: 实际拍摄方法 (actual shooting methods), 成像原理 (imaging principles), 不同条件下的调整 (adjustments under different conditions). NOT 器材促销 (equipment promotions) or 摄影师私生活 (photographers' private lives).\n\nSo the relevant content types are:\n- **条件与原理** (conditions & principles) - imaging principles ✓\n- **操作记录** (operation records) - actual shooting methods ✓\n- **概念速览** (concept overview) - learning concepts ✓\n\nNOT relevant:\n- **市场观察** (market observation) - equipment promotions ✗\n- **专题观察** (special topic observation) - exhibition/author biography/art history ✗\n\nLet me identify the candidates matching the relevant types. I need to select 20 distinct candidates.\n\nLet me scan through the candidates and categorize them.\n\nRelevant candidates (条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览):\n\nLet me list them by type:\n\n**条件与原理 (conditions & principles):**\n- item-03b7af37b88f 逆光人像：黄昏户外中的条件与原理\n- item-04f2ff24ab7e 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的条件与原理\n- item-061d97575247 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的条件与原理\n- item-1a2494e4589c 逆光人像：阴天街道中的条件与原理\n- item-2130f01f2f2c 风光滤镜：低照度室内中的条件与原理\n- item-287bd2a75b9a 雨天反光：低照度室内中的条件与原理\n- item-28b65f550fe1 微距景深：黄昏户外中的条件与原理\n- item-2c0456eef787 夜景曝光：窗边自然光中的条件与原理\n- item-2cbc282bedc9 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外中的条件与原理\n- item-305dca4b57c4 静物布光：低照度室内中的条件与原理\n- item-3ed55ed7b588 雨天反光：阴天街道中的条件与原理\n- item-4ef7a9b648bc 夜景曝光：黄昏户外中的条件与原理\n- item-5483802ef951 室内白平衡：窗边自然光中的条件与原理\n- item-598ec31e514b 儿童抓拍：阴天街道中的条件与原理\n- item-5c7e77e24c87 风光滤镜：窗边自然光中的条件与原理\n- item-6602f232e957 雨天反光：黄昏户外中的条件与原理\n- item-6d5b1bdb4843 逆光人像：窗边自然光中的条件与原理\n- item-707e06945b80 逆光人像：低照度室内中的条件与原理\n- item-7d209764a808 微距景深：阴天街道中的条件与原理\n- item-8c818d43203a 儿童抓拍：低照度室内中的条件与原理\n- item-9df219efa583 街头构图：窗边自然光中的条件与原理\n\n**操作记录 (operation records):**\n- item-10d5a61a7f0a 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的操作记录\n- item-12a571ccfc9e 逆光人像：阴天街道中的操作记录\n- item-225af9fad31a 室内白平衡：阴天街道中的操作记录\n- item-2589e00e0e34 微距景深：低照度室内中的操作记录\n- item-2591e5ddcc17 微距景深：窗边自然光中的操作记录\n- item-274920178d43 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外中的操作记录\n- item-30b99cdb0a88 静物布光：阴天街道中的操作记录\n- item-3741cf536903 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的操作记录\n- item-38f75ee3d0a0 风光滤镜：阴天街道中的操作记录\n- item-3c7c2f99c9b1 运动追焦：窗边自然光中的操作记录\n- item-4fdd105846ab 街头构图：黄昏户外中的操作记录\n- item-5549ef7739ee 风光滤镜：低照度室内中的操作记录\n- item-5ccdd6fcc600 夜景曝光：低照度室内中的操作记录\n- item-5eb9bdedd6fe 微距景深：阴天街道中的操作记录\n- item-68a3d6c10d1d 街头构图：低照度室内中的操作记录\n- item-68e02d14b075 儿童抓拍：低照度室内中的操作记